(566,360,$mw$93F6483589F03F8A3C3F7FA052A59EDD0D8E3FB4F4B5816ED91DA6E2DBEAC299$mw$,$mw$c7f7f3e0ce946c6cc11b8a01a41021f7$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":360,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":15,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=4\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(5)\\).","TitleEn":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=4\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(5)\\).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=4\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(5)\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=4\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(5)\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: إذا كانت المشتقة الثانية y″ = 0، فالمشتقة الأولى ثابتة y′ = C₁ والدالة خطية y = C₁x + C₂. من y′(0) = 4 نجد C₁ = 4، ومن y(0) = 5 نجد C₂ = 5. إذن y(5) = 4 × 5 + 5 = 25.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: If y″ = 0, then y′ is constant and y(x) = C₁x + C₂. The conditions y′(0) = 4 and y(0) = 5 yield C₁ = 4, C₂ = 5. Thus y(5) = 4 × 5 + 5 = 25. Differentiate twice to check that y″ = 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1429,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"23","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1430,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"25","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1431,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"26","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1432,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"28","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد عدد التكاملات من رتبة المعادلة.","En":"Use the order to determine the number of integrations."},{"Ar":"حدد ثابت كل تكامل من الشرط الموافق له.","En":"Determine each constant using the corresponding condition."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=4\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(5)\\).","En":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=4\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(5)\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $20$؛ اختيار $23$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $3$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $20$; choice $23$ requires integration constant $3$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"23"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"25"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $20$؛ اختيار $26$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $6$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $20$; choice $26$ requires integration constant $6$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"26"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $20$؛ اختيار $28$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $8$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $20$; choice $28$ requires integration constant $8$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"28"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=4\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(5)\\).","En":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=4\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(5)\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تكامل المشتقة الثانية مرتين يعطي دالة خطية بثابتين.","En":"Integrating the second derivative twice gives a linear function with two constants."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"من $y''=0$ يكون $y'$ ثابتاً، والشرط $y'(0)=4$ يحدده.","En":"From $y''=0$, $y'$ is constant, fixed by $y'(0)=4$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=4x+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=4x+5$; then evaluate the requested input."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$25$","En":"$25$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط شرط المشتقة بشرط الدالة.","En":"Do not confuse derivative and function conditions."},"FormulaLatex":"y''=0\\Rightarrow y'=C_1\\Rightarrow y=C_1x+C_2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(5)=4(5)+5=25$","En":"$y(5)=4(5)+5=25$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4x+5)''=0,\\quad y'(0)=4,\\quad y(0)=5$","En":"$(4x+5)''=0,\\quad y'(0)=4,\\quad y(0)=5$"}},"TrackIds":[15,21],"CategoryId":15,"PrimarySkillId":69,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد عدد التكاملات من رتبة المعادلة.","En":"Use the order to determine the number of integrations."},{"Ar":"حدد ثابت كل تكامل من الشرط الموافق له.","En":"Determine each constant using the corresponding condition."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تكامل المشتقة الثانية مرتين يعطي دالة خطية بثابتين.","En":"Integrating the second derivative twice gives a linear function with two constants."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"من $y''=0$ يكون $y'$ ثابتاً، والشرط $y'(0)=4$ يحدده.","En":"From $y''=0$, $y'$ is constant, fixed by $y'(0)=4$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=4x+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=4x+5$; then evaluate the requested input."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$25$","En":"$25$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط شرط المشتقة بشرط الدالة.","En":"Do not confuse derivative and function conditions."},"FormulaLatex":"y''=0\\Rightarrow y'=C_1\\Rightarrow y=C_1x+C_2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(5)=4(5)+5=25$","En":"$y(5)=4(5)+5=25$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4x+5)''=0,\\quad y'(0)=4,\\quad y(0)=5$","En":"$(4x+5)''=0,\\quad y'(0)=4,\\quad y(0)=5$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $20$؛ اختيار $23$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $3$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $20$; choice $23$ requires integration constant $3$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $20$؛ اختيار $26$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $6$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $20$; choice $26$ requires integration constant $6$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $20$؛ اختيار $28$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $8$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $20$; choice $28$ requires integration constant $8$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$تكامل المشتقة الثانية مرتين يعطي دالة خطية بثابتين.

$y''=0\Rightarrow y'=C_1\Rightarrow y=C_1x+C_2$

1. من $y''=0$ يكون $y'$ ثابتاً، والشرط $y'(0)=4$ يحدده.

2. باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=4x+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.

$y(5)=4(5)+5=25$

$25$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(4x+5)''=0,\quad y'(0)=4,\quad y(0)=5$

لا تخلط شرط المشتقة بشرط الدالة.$mw$,$mw$Integrating the second derivative twice gives a linear function with two constants.

$y''=0\Rightarrow y'=C_1\Rightarrow y=C_1x+C_2$

1. From $y''=0$, $y'$ is constant, fixed by $y'(0)=4$.

2. Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=4x+5$; then evaluate the requested input.

$y(5)=4(5)+5=25$

$25$ Dimensionless

$(4x+5)''=0,\quad y'(0)=4,\quad y(0)=5$

Do not confuse derivative and function conditions.$mw$),
(567,361,$mw$4D19DC020D569CE38A5287DE797948F27463C28EDAE22968FE2D3F3E917B6A8E$mw$,$mw$c10b441b13ada2061f83ddb549edd419$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":361,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":15,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(y'=8x\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(4)\\).","TitleEn":"Given \\(y'=8x\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(4)\\).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(y'=8x\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(4)\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(y'=8x\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(4)\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قاعدة تكامل القوى: ∫x dx = x²/2. إذا كانت y′ = 8x، فإن y = (8/2)x² + C = 4x² + C. من y(0) = 5 نحصل على C = 5. بالتعويض x = 4: ‏y(4) = 4 × 4² + 5 = 69. التحقق: المشتقة y′ = 8x.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Power integration rule: ∫x dx = x²/2. Given y′ = 8x, integrate to y = (8/2)x² + C = 4x² + C. Use y(0) = 5 to find C = 5. Then y(4) = 4 × 4² + 5 = 69. Differentiating yields y′ = 8x.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1433,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"69","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1434,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"70","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1435,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"72","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1436,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"67","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بتكامل الطرف الأيمن.","En":"Start by integrating the right side."},{"Ar":"حدد الثابت من قيمة y عند الصفر ثم عوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Find the constant from y at zero, then evaluate the requested input."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y'=8x\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(4)\\).","En":"Given \\(y'=8x\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(4)\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"69"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $64$؛ اختيار $70$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $6$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $64$; choice $70$ requires integration constant $6$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"70"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $64$؛ اختيار $72$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $8$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $64$; choice $72$ requires integration constant $8$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"72"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $64$؛ اختيار $67$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $3$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $64$; choice $67$ requires integration constant $3$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"67"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y'=8x\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(4)\\).","En":"Given \\(y'=8x\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(4)\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"بالتكامل نحصل على $y=4x^2+C$.","En":"Integration gives $y=4x^2+C$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=4x^2+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=4x^2+5$; then evaluate the requested input."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$69$","En":"$69$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Do not omit the initial condition."},"FormulaLatex":"y(x)=y(0)+\\int_0^x g(t)\\,dt","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(4)=4(4)^2+5=69$","En":"$y(4)=4(4)^2+5=69$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4x^2+5)'=8x,\\quad y(0)=5$","En":"$(4x^2+5)'=8x,\\quad y(0)=5$"}},"TrackIds":[15,21],"CategoryId":15,"PrimarySkillId":68,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بتكامل الطرف الأيمن.","En":"Start by integrating the right side."},{"Ar":"حدد الثابت من قيمة y عند الصفر ثم عوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Find the constant from y at zero, then evaluate the requested input."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"بالتكامل نحصل على $y=4x^2+C$.","En":"Integration gives $y=4x^2+C$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=4x^2+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=4x^2+5$; then evaluate the requested input."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$69$","En":"$69$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Do not omit the initial condition."},"FormulaLatex":"y(x)=y(0)+\\int_0^x g(t)\\,dt","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(4)=4(4)^2+5=69$","En":"$y(4)=4(4)^2+5=69$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4x^2+5)'=8x,\\quad y(0)=5$","En":"$(4x^2+5)'=8x,\\quad y(0)=5$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $64$؛ اختيار $70$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $6$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $64$; choice $70$ requires integration constant $6$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $64$؛ اختيار $72$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $8$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $64$; choice $72$ requires integration constant $8$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $64$؛ اختيار $67$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $3$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $64$; choice $67$ requires integration constant $3$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.

$y(x)=y(0)+\int_0^x g(t)\,dt$

1. بالتكامل نحصل على $y=4x^2+C$.

2. باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=4x^2+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.

$y(4)=4(4)^2+5=69$

$69$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(4x^2+5)'=8x,\quad y(0)=5$

لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.$mw$,$mw$Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition.

$y(x)=y(0)+\int_0^x g(t)\,dt$

1. Integration gives $y=4x^2+C$.

2. Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=4x^2+5$; then evaluate the requested input.

$y(4)=4(4)^2+5=69$

$69$ Dimensionless

$(4x^2+5)'=8x,\quad y(0)=5$

Do not omit the initial condition.$mw$),
(568,362,$mw$A5801FDCF9CC2E00D70B829FEE865EE5C6D6CF93F189295C50A94AC63EC2F777$mw$,$mw$b00b535e9d43f68c9baa1b696aa8fe63$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":362,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":36,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"أوجد نهاية \\(a_n=\\frac{4}{n+1}\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\).","TitleEn":"Find limit of \\(a_n=\\frac{4}{n+1}\\) as n tends to infinity.","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد نهاية \\(a_n=\\frac{4}{n+1}\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Find limit of \\(a_n=\\frac{4}{n+1}\\) as n tends to infinity.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: الكسر ذو البسط الثابت والمقام الذي يزداد إلى ما لا نهاية يتقارب إلى الصفر. للمتتالية aₙ = 4/(n+1)، لأي ε > 0 نختار n أكبر من 4/ε، عندها 0 < 4/(n+1) < ε. إذن lim(aₙ) عندما n → ∞ يساوي 0.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: A constant divided by a denominator increasing without bound has limit zero. For aₙ = 4/(n+1), given any ε > 0 choose n > 4/ε. Then 0 < 4/(n+1) < ε, proving lim(n→∞) aₙ = 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1437,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"+\\infty","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1438,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1439,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1440,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"راقب سلوك الحد مع ازدياد الرتبة.","En":"Examine term behavior as the index increases."},{"Ar":"قارن الكسر بكمية تؤول للصفر.","En":"Compare with a quantity tending to zero."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد نهاية \\(a_n=\\frac{4}{n+1}\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\).","En":"Find limit of \\(a_n=\\frac{4}{n+1}\\) as n tends to infinity."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"خلط نمو المقام أو الأس مع نمو الحد نفسه؛ الحد يتناقص.","En":"Confuses growth of the denominator or exponent with growth of the term; the term decreases."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"+\\infty"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $1$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $1$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $4$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $4$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد نهاية \\(a_n=\\frac{4}{n+1}\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\).","En":"Find limit of \\(a_n=\\frac{4}{n+1}\\) as n tends to infinity."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"البسط ثابت والمقام يزداد بلا حد.","En":"A fixed numerator is divided by an unbounded denominator."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"البسط $4$ ثابت، والمقام يزداد بلا حد.","En":"The numerator $4$ is fixed and the denominator grows without bound."},{"Ar":"لـ $n\\ge1$، لدينا $0<\\frac{4}{n+1}\\le\\frac{4}n$؛ نطبق مبرهنة الحصر.","En":"For $n\\ge1$, $0<\\frac{4}{n+1}\\le\\frac{4}n$; apply the squeeze theorem."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بالنهاية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{c}{n+1}=0\\quad(c>0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{4}{n+1}=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{4}{n+1}=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"لكل $\\varepsilon>0$، يكفي $n>4/\\varepsilon$.","En":"For every $\\varepsilon>0$, $n>4/\\varepsilon$ suffices."}},"TrackIds":[13,20],"CategoryId":36,"PrimarySkillId":72,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"راقب سلوك الحد مع ازدياد الرتبة.","En":"Examine term behavior as the index increases."},{"Ar":"قارن الكسر بكمية تؤول للصفر.","En":"Compare with a quantity tending to zero."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"البسط ثابت والمقام يزداد بلا حد.","En":"A fixed numerator is divided by an unbounded denominator."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"البسط $4$ ثابت، والمقام يزداد بلا حد.","En":"The numerator $4$ is fixed and the denominator grows without bound."},{"Ar":"لـ $n\\ge1$، لدينا $0<\\frac{4}{n+1}\\le\\frac{4}n$؛ نطبق مبرهنة الحصر.","En":"For $n\\ge1$, $0<\\frac{4}{n+1}\\le\\frac{4}n$; apply the squeeze theorem."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بالنهاية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{c}{n+1}=0\\quad(c>0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{4}{n+1}=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{4}{n+1}=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"لكل $\\varepsilon>0$، يكفي $n>4/\\varepsilon$.","En":"For every $\\varepsilon>0$, $n>4/\\varepsilon$ suffices."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"خلط نمو المقام أو الأس مع نمو الحد نفسه؛ الحد يتناقص.","En":"Confuses growth of the denominator or exponent with growth of the term; the term decreases."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $1$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $1$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $4$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $4$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$البسط ثابت والمقام يزداد بلا حد.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{c}{n+1}=0\quad(c>0)$

1. البسط $4$ ثابت، والمقام يزداد بلا حد.

2. لـ $n\ge1$، لدينا $0<\frac{4}{n+1}\le\frac{4}n$؛ نطبق مبرهنة الحصر.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{4}{n+1}=0$

$0$ بلا وحدة قياس

لكل $\varepsilon>0$، يكفي $n>4/\varepsilon$.

لا تخلط الحد الأول بالنهاية.$mw$,$mw$A fixed numerator is divided by an unbounded denominator.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{c}{n+1}=0\quad(c>0)$

1. The numerator $4$ is fixed and the denominator grows without bound.

2. For $n\ge1$, $0<\frac{4}{n+1}\le\frac{4}n$; apply the squeeze theorem.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{4}{n+1}=0$

$0$ Dimensionless

For every $\varepsilon>0$, $n>4/\varepsilon$ suffices.

Do not confuse the first term with the limit.$mw$),
(569,363,$mw$DF7681A2101B0FB2D9181BDE20944F93E40283D3A59A4AA25780B6631983E886$mw$,$mw$17c834e18c2fefc610fd17f47376d42e$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":363,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":36,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما نهاية \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{4})^n\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\)؟","TitleEn":"Find the limit of \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{4})^n\\) as n tends to infinity.","QuestionTextAr":"ما نهاية \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{4})^n\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the limit of \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{4})^n\\) as n tends to infinity.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: إذا كان |r| < 1 فإن المتتالية الهندسية rⁿ تتقارب إلى الصفر. في حالتنا r = 1/4، وهو بين الصفر والواحد؛ بالتالي aₙ = (1/4)ⁿ = 1/4ⁿ. ومع زيادة n يكبر المقام 4ⁿ بلا حد، لذا lim(aₙ) = 0.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: For a geometric sequence rⁿ with |r| < 1, the terms tend to zero. Here r = 1/4 lies strictly between 0 and 1, so aₙ = (1/4)ⁿ = 1/4ⁿ. As n increases, 4ⁿ grows without bound; hence lim aₙ = 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1441,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1442,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1443,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{4}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1444,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"+\\infty","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"راقب سلوك الحد مع ازدياد الرتبة.","En":"Examine term behavior as the index increases."},{"Ar":"تحقق من القيمة المطلقة للأساس.","En":"Check the absolute value of the base."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما نهاية \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{4})^n\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\)؟","En":"Find the limit of \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{4})^n\\) as n tends to infinity."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $1$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $1$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $\\frac{1}{4}$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $\\frac{1}{4}$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"خلط نمو المقام أو الأس مع نمو الحد نفسه؛ الحد يتناقص.","En":"Confuses growth of the denominator or exponent with growth of the term; the term decreases."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"+\\infty"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما نهاية \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{4})^n\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\)؟","En":"Find the limit of \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{4})^n\\) as n tends to infinity."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قوى نسبة مطلقة أصغر من واحد تؤول للصفر.","En":"Powers of a ratio below one in magnitude tend to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس $\\frac1{4}$ موجب وأصغر من واحد.","En":"The base $\\frac1{4}$ is positive and less than one."},{"Ar":"كل ضرب جديد بهذا الأساس يصغّر الحد، فتؤول القوى إلى الصفر.","En":"Each multiplication by this base reduces the term, so the powers tend to zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بالنهاية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}r^n=0\\quad(|r|<1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(\\frac1{4})^n=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(\\frac1{4})^n=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$0<(\\frac1{4})^n\\le(\\frac12)^n\\to0$","En":"$0<(\\frac1{4})^n\\le(\\frac12)^n\\to0$"}},"TrackIds":[13,20],"CategoryId":36,"PrimarySkillId":72,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"راقب سلوك الحد مع ازدياد الرتبة.","En":"Examine term behavior as the index increases."},{"Ar":"تحقق من القيمة المطلقة للأساس.","En":"Check the absolute value of the base."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قوى نسبة مطلقة أصغر من واحد تؤول للصفر.","En":"Powers of a ratio below one in magnitude tend to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس $\\frac1{4}$ موجب وأصغر من واحد.","En":"The base $\\frac1{4}$ is positive and less than one."},{"Ar":"كل ضرب جديد بهذا الأساس يصغّر الحد، فتؤول القوى إلى الصفر.","En":"Each multiplication by this base reduces the term, so the powers tend to zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بالنهاية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}r^n=0\\quad(|r|<1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(\\frac1{4})^n=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(\\frac1{4})^n=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$0<(\\frac1{4})^n\\le(\\frac12)^n\\to0$","En":"$0<(\\frac1{4})^n\\le(\\frac12)^n\\to0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $1$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $1$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $\\frac{1}{4}$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $\\frac{1}{4}$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"خلط نمو المقام أو الأس مع نمو الحد نفسه؛ الحد يتناقص.","En":"Confuses growth of the denominator or exponent with growth of the term; the term decreases."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قوى نسبة مطلقة أصغر من واحد تؤول للصفر.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}r^n=0\quad(|r|<1)$

1. الأساس $\frac1{4}$ موجب وأصغر من واحد.

2. كل ضرب جديد بهذا الأساس يصغّر الحد، فتؤول القوى إلى الصفر.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}(\frac1{4})^n=0$

$0$ بلا وحدة قياس

$0<(\frac1{4})^n\le(\frac12)^n\to0$

لا تخلط الحد الأول بالنهاية.$mw$,$mw$Powers of a ratio below one in magnitude tend to zero.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}r^n=0\quad(|r|<1)$

1. The base $\frac1{4}$ is positive and less than one.

2. Each multiplication by this base reduces the term, so the powers tend to zero.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}(\frac1{4})^n=0$

$0$ Dimensionless

$0<(\frac1{4})^n\le(\frac12)^n\to0$

Do not confuse the first term with the limit.$mw$),
(571,365,$mw$8E6D22E154FD623FEA8B39002961D63BF1ABF271C3D546D9603699FE4CE6DE32$mw$,$mw$2afccc38236855ed77ce03266caa8ded$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":365,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=5x^2y+4y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (5،6).","TitleEn":"Given \\(f(x,y)=5x^2y+4y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (5,6).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=5x^2y+4y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (5،6).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(f(x,y)=5x^2y+4y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (5,6).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون المشتقة الجزئية بالنسبة إلى ص: نعامل س كثابت. للدالة f(س،ص) = 5س²ص + 4ص² نجد ∂f/∂ص = 5س² + 8ص. عند (5،6) نحسب 5 × 5² + 8 × 6 = 125 + 48 = 173.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Partial derivative with respect to y: Treat x as constant. For f(x,y)=5x²y+4y², ∂f/∂y=5x²+8y. At (5,6), calculate 5×5²+8×6=125+48=173.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1449,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"174","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1450,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"176","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1451,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"171","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1452,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"173","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المتغير المطلوب.","En":"Identify the differentiation variable."},{"Ar":"اشتق بالنسبة إلى y مع تثبيت x ثم عوض.","En":"Differentiate in y holding x fixed, then substitute."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=5x^2y+4y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (5،6).","En":"Given \\(f(x,y)=5x^2y+4y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (5,6)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $125$ و$48$؛ اختيار $174$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $1$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $125$ and $48$; choice $174$ differs from their sum by $1$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"174"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $125$ و$48$؛ اختيار $176$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $3$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $125$ and $48$; choice $176$ differs from their sum by $3$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"176"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $125$ و$48$؛ اختيار $171$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $2$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $125$ and $48$; choice $171$ differs from their sum by $2$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"171"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"173"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=5x^2y+4y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (5،6).","En":"Given \\(f(x,y)=5x^2y+4y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (5,6)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض النقطة.","En":"Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then evaluate at the point."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ثبّت $x$؛ مشتقة $5x^2y$ بالنسبة إلى $y$ هي $5x^2$.","En":"Hold $x$ fixed; the derivative of $5x^2y$ in $y$ is $5x^2$."},{"Ar":"مشتقة $4y^2$ هي $8y$؛ نجمع الحدين ثم نعوض النقطة.","En":"Differentiate $4y^2$ to obtain $8y$; add the terms and evaluate the point."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$173$","En":"$173$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض قبل الاشتقاق.","En":"Do not substitute before differentiating."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}=5x^2+8y","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5(5)^2+8(6)=125+48=173$","En":"$5(5)^2+8(6)=125+48=173$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(5,6+h)-f(5,6)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(173+4h)=173$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(5,6+h)-f(5,6)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(173+4h)=173$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":57,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المتغير المطلوب.","En":"Identify the differentiation variable."},{"Ar":"اشتق بالنسبة إلى y مع تثبيت x ثم عوض.","En":"Differentiate in y holding x fixed, then substitute."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض النقطة.","En":"Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then evaluate at the point."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ثبّت $x$؛ مشتقة $5x^2y$ بالنسبة إلى $y$ هي $5x^2$.","En":"Hold $x$ fixed; the derivative of $5x^2y$ in $y$ is $5x^2$."},{"Ar":"مشتقة $4y^2$ هي $8y$؛ نجمع الحدين ثم نعوض النقطة.","En":"Differentiate $4y^2$ to obtain $8y$; add the terms and evaluate the point."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$173$","En":"$173$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض قبل الاشتقاق.","En":"Do not substitute before differentiating."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}=5x^2+8y","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5(5)^2+8(6)=125+48=173$","En":"$5(5)^2+8(6)=125+48=173$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(5,6+h)-f(5,6)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(173+4h)=173$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(5,6+h)-f(5,6)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(173+4h)=173$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $125$ و$48$؛ اختيار $174$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $1$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $125$ and $48$; choice $174$ differs from their sum by $1$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $125$ و$48$؛ اختيار $176$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $3$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $125$ and $48$; choice $176$ differs from their sum by $3$."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $125$ و$48$؛ اختيار $171$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $2$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $125$ and $48$; choice $171$ differs from their sum by $2$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض النقطة.

$\frac{\partial f}{\partial y}=5x^2+8y$

1. ثبّت $x$؛ مشتقة $5x^2y$ بالنسبة إلى $y$ هي $5x^2$.

2. مشتقة $4y^2$ هي $8y$؛ نجمع الحدين ثم نعوض النقطة.

$5(5)^2+8(6)=125+48=173$

$173$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(5,6+h)-f(5,6)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(173+4h)=173$

لا تعوض قبل الاشتقاق.$mw$,$mw$Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then evaluate at the point.

$\frac{\partial f}{\partial y}=5x^2+8y$

1. Hold $x$ fixed; the derivative of $5x^2y$ in $y$ is $5x^2$.

2. Differentiate $4y^2$ to obtain $8y$; add the terms and evaluate the point.

$5(5)^2+8(6)=125+48=173$

$173$ Dimensionless

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(5,6+h)-f(5,6)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(173+4h)=173$

Do not substitute before differentiating.$mw$),
(572,366,$mw$07767C6065657D41B3C258FCAE2976EBCF4762CA55C48CDD9C8B88E48D24D94F$mw$,$mw$56c04a65d678b59af56b094667424dd8$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":366,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (5،6)؟","TitleEn":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (5,6).","QuestionTextAr":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (5،6)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (5,6).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون التدرج: ∇f(س،ص) = (∂f/∂س،∂f/∂ص). للدالة f(س،ص) = س² + ص²، التدرج هو (2س،2ص). عند النقطة (5،6) تصبح المركبتان (2 × 5،2 × 6) = (10،12). هذا متجه وليس عدداً واحداً.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Gradient rule: ∇f=(∂f/∂x,∂f/∂y). For f(x,y)=x²+y², ∇f=(2x,2y). At (5,6), the result is (2×5,2×6)=(10,12). A gradient is a vector, not a scalar.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1453,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(12,10)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1454,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(10,-12)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1455,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(10,12)","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1456,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(5,6)","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب المشتقتين الجزئيتين.","En":"Compute both partial derivatives."},{"Ar":"رتب مشتقة x ثم y وعوض النقطة.","En":"Order the x-partial before the y-partial and evaluate."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (5،6)؟","En":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (5,6)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المشتقتين.","En":"Swaps derivative components."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(12,10)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"غيّر إشارة المشتقة الثانية رغم أن إحداثيها موجب.","En":"Negates the second derivative component despite a positive coordinate."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(10,-12)"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"(10,12)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"أعاد إحداثيي النقطة دون اشتقاق.","En":"Returns input coordinates without differentiating."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(5,6)"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (5،6)؟","En":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (5,6)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التدرج متجه المشتقات الجزئية بالترتيب.","En":"The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$ فنحصل على $2x$.","En":"Differentiate in $x$ holding $y$ fixed to get $2x$."},{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.","En":"Differentiate in $y$ holding $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain the component order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(10,12)$","En":"$(10,12)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدل المركبتين.","En":"Do not swap the components."},"FormulaLatex":"\\nabla f=(2x,2y)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\nabla f(5,6)=(2\\cdot5,2\\cdot6)=(10,12)$","En":"$\\nabla f(5,6)=(2\\cdot5,2\\cdot6)=(10,12)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f_x(5,6)=10,\\quad f_y(5,6)=12$","En":"$f_x(5,6)=10,\\quad f_y(5,6)=12$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":59,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب المشتقتين الجزئيتين.","En":"Compute both partial derivatives."},{"Ar":"رتب مشتقة x ثم y وعوض النقطة.","En":"Order the x-partial before the y-partial and evaluate."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التدرج متجه المشتقات الجزئية بالترتيب.","En":"The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$ فنحصل على $2x$.","En":"Differentiate in $x$ holding $y$ fixed to get $2x$."},{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.","En":"Differentiate in $y$ holding $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain the component order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(10,12)$","En":"$(10,12)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدل المركبتين.","En":"Do not swap the components."},"FormulaLatex":"\\nabla f=(2x,2y)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\nabla f(5,6)=(2\\cdot5,2\\cdot6)=(10,12)$","En":"$\\nabla f(5,6)=(2\\cdot5,2\\cdot6)=(10,12)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f_x(5,6)=10,\\quad f_y(5,6)=12$","En":"$f_x(5,6)=10,\\quad f_y(5,6)=12$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المشتقتين.","En":"Swaps derivative components."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"غيّر إشارة المشتقة الثانية رغم أن إحداثيها موجب.","En":"Negates the second derivative component despite a positive coordinate."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"أعاد إحداثيي النقطة دون اشتقاق.","En":"Returns input coordinates without differentiating."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التدرج متجه المشتقات الجزئية بالترتيب.

$\nabla f=(2x,2y)$

1. نشتق بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$ فنحصل على $2x$.

2. نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.

$\nabla f(5,6)=(2\cdot5,2\cdot6)=(10,12)$

$(10,12)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$f_x(5,6)=10,\quad f_y(5,6)=12$

لا تبدل المركبتين.$mw$,$mw$The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives.

$\nabla f=(2x,2y)$

1. Differentiate in $x$ holding $y$ fixed to get $2x$.

2. Differentiate in $y$ holding $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain the component order.

$\nabla f(5,6)=(2\cdot5,2\cdot6)=(10,12)$

$(10,12)$ Dimensionless

$f_x(5,6)=10,\quad f_y(5,6)=12$

Do not swap the components.$mw$),
(573,367,$mw$39397EF11E58BE097DFBF1A508E2E66778D7BB4396EE52DE92E05CF79456190B$mw$,$mw$641ffa186b40f0f680166ceb2288c040$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":367,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (4،5) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","TitleEn":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (4,5) in positive x-direction.","QuestionTextAr":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (4،5) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","QuestionTextEn":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (4,5) in positive x-direction.","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون المشتقة الاتجاهية في اتجاه وحدة u: Dᵤf = ∇f · u. للدالة f(س،ص) = س² + 3ص² يكون ∇f = (2س،6ص). اتجاه س الموجب يساوي متجه الوحدة u=(1،0)، لذا Dᵤf = 2س × 1 + 6ص × 0 = 2س. عند (4،5) الناتج 8.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Directional derivative: D_u f = ∇f · u for a unit direction u. For f(x,y)=x²+3y², ∇f=(2x,6y). The positive x-direction is u=(1,0), so D_u f=2x×1+6y×0=2x. At (4,5), this equals 8.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1457,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1458,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1459,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1460,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد متجه وحدة الاتجاه الموجب لمحور x.","En":"Identify the positive x-axis unit direction."},{"Ar":"احسب التدرج عند النقطة ثم اضربه قياسياً في متجه الاتجاه.","En":"Evaluate the gradient at the point and dot it with the direction."}],"Title":{"Ar":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (4،5) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","En":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (4,5) in positive x-direction."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $6$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $4$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $6$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $4$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $9$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $4$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $9$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $4$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $11$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $4$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $11$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $4$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (4،5) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","En":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (4,5) in positive x-direction."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.","En":"The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المشتقتان الجزئيتان $2x$ و$6y$، ومتجه وحدة الاتجاه هو $(1,0)$.","En":"The partials are $2x$ and $6y$, with direction unit vector $(1,0)$."},{"Ar":"التدرج عند النقطة $(8,30)$؛ الجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.","En":"The gradient at the point is $(8,30)$; the dot product selects the first component."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.","En":"Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection."},"FormulaLatex":"D_{\\mathbf u}f=\\nabla f\\cdot\\mathbf u,\\quad \\mathbf u=(1,0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(8,30)\\cdot(1,0)=8$","En":"$(8,30)\\cdot(1,0)=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(4+h,5)-f(4,5)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(8+h)=8$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(4+h,5)-f(4,5)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(8+h)=8$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":60,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد متجه وحدة الاتجاه الموجب لمحور x.","En":"Identify the positive x-axis unit direction."},{"Ar":"احسب التدرج عند النقطة ثم اضربه قياسياً في متجه الاتجاه.","En":"Evaluate the gradient at the point and dot it with the direction."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.","En":"The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المشتقتان الجزئيتان $2x$ و$6y$، ومتجه وحدة الاتجاه هو $(1,0)$.","En":"The partials are $2x$ and $6y$, with direction unit vector $(1,0)$."},{"Ar":"التدرج عند النقطة $(8,30)$؛ الجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.","En":"The gradient at the point is $(8,30)$; the dot product selects the first component."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.","En":"Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection."},"FormulaLatex":"D_{\\mathbf u}f=\\nabla f\\cdot\\mathbf u,\\quad \\mathbf u=(1,0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(8,30)\\cdot(1,0)=8$","En":"$(8,30)\\cdot(1,0)=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(4+h,5)-f(4,5)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(8+h)=8$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(4+h,5)-f(4,5)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(8+h)=8$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $6$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $4$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $6$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $4$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $9$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $4$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $9$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $4$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $11$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $4$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $11$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $4$."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.

$D_{\mathbf u}f=\nabla f\cdot\mathbf u,\quad \mathbf u=(1,0)$

1. المشتقتان الجزئيتان $2x$ و$6y$، ومتجه وحدة الاتجاه هو $(1,0)$.

2. التدرج عند النقطة $(8,30)$؛ الجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.

$(8,30)\cdot(1,0)=8$

$8$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(4+h,5)-f(4,5)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(8+h)=8$

لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.$mw$,$mw$The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector.

$D_{\mathbf u}f=\nabla f\cdot\mathbf u,\quad \mathbf u=(1,0)$

1. The partials are $2x$ and $6y$, with direction unit vector $(1,0)$.

2. The gradient at the point is $(8,30)$; the dot product selects the first component.

$(8,30)\cdot(1,0)=8$

$8$ Dimensionless

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(4+h,5)-f(4,5)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(8+h)=8$

Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection.$mw$),
(574,368,$mw$556D230245E69922E9E4B10D8BEE0E711E761A791832B3DAB735FFF42EFE6996$mw$,$mw$c0c297d36d7ed1dda411417ff501f73a$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":368,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":14,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما أثر المصفوفة \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&0\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","TitleEn":"Find trace of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&0\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"ما أثر المصفوفة \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&0\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find trace of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&0\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"تعريف أثر المصفوفة المربعة tr(A): مجموع عناصر القطر الرئيسي من أعلى اليسار إلى أسفل اليمين. المصفوفة المعطاة قطرها الرئيسي 5 و7، لذا tr(A) = 5 + 7 = 12. لا نخلط بين الأثر والمحدد، فالعمليتان مختلفتان.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Trace of a square matrix is the sum of its main diagonal entries. Here the main diagonal contains 5 and 7, so tr(A) = 5 + 7 = 12. The trace is not the determinant.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1461,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"15","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1462,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1463,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1464,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد القطر الرئيسي.","En":"Identify the main diagonal."},{"Ar":"اجمع عناصر القطر الرئيسي فقط.","En":"Sum only the main diagonal entries."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما أثر المصفوفة \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&0\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","En":"Find trace of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&0\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $15$ تختلف عن مجموع عنصري القطر بمقدار $3$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $15$ differs from the diagonal sum by $3$; recheck the addition without introducing other entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"15"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $10$ تختلف عن مجموع عنصري القطر بمقدار $2$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $10$ differs from the diagonal sum by $2$; recheck the addition without introducing other entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"12"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $13$ تختلف عن مجموع عنصري القطر بمقدار $1$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $13$ differs from the diagonal sum by $1$; recheck the addition without introducing other entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"13"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما أثر المصفوفة \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&0\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","En":"Find trace of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&0\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"أثر المصفوفة مجموع عناصر القطر الرئيسي.","En":"Matrix trace is the sum of the main diagonal entries."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عنصرا القطر الرئيسي هما $5$ و$7$.","En":"The main diagonal entries are $5$ and $7$."},{"Ar":"نجمعهما فقط؛ لا نضربهما ولا نضيف عناصر أخرى.","En":"Add them only; do not multiply them or introduce other entries."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$12$","En":"$12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الأثر بالمحدد.","En":"Do not confuse trace with determinant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{tr}(A)=a_{11}+a_{22}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5+7=12$","En":"$5+7=12$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$7+5=12$","En":"$7+5=12$"}},"TrackIds":[14,20],"CategoryId":14,"PrimarySkillId":64,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد القطر الرئيسي.","En":"Identify the main diagonal."},{"Ar":"اجمع عناصر القطر الرئيسي فقط.","En":"Sum only the main diagonal entries."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"أثر المصفوفة مجموع عناصر القطر الرئيسي.","En":"Matrix trace is the sum of the main diagonal entries."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عنصرا القطر الرئيسي هما $5$ و$7$.","En":"The main diagonal entries are $5$ and $7$."},{"Ar":"نجمعهما فقط؛ لا نضربهما ولا نضيف عناصر أخرى.","En":"Add them only; do not multiply them or introduce other entries."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$12$","En":"$12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الأثر بالمحدد.","En":"Do not confuse trace with determinant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{tr}(A)=a_{11}+a_{22}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5+7=12$","En":"$5+7=12$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$7+5=12$","En":"$7+5=12$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $15$ تختلف عن مجموع عنصري القطر بمقدار $3$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $15$ differs from the diagonal sum by $3$; recheck the addition without introducing other entries."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $10$ تختلف عن مجموع عنصري القطر بمقدار $2$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $10$ differs from the diagonal sum by $2$; recheck the addition without introducing other entries."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $13$ تختلف عن مجموع عنصري القطر بمقدار $1$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $13$ differs from the diagonal sum by $1$; recheck the addition without introducing other entries."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$أثر المصفوفة مجموع عناصر القطر الرئيسي.

$\operatorname{tr}(A)=a_{11}+a_{22}$

1. عنصرا القطر الرئيسي هما $5$ و$7$.

2. نجمعهما فقط؛ لا نضربهما ولا نضيف عناصر أخرى.

$5+7=12$

$12$ بلا وحدة قياس

$7+5=12$

لا تخلط الأثر بالمحدد.$mw$,$mw$Matrix trace is the sum of the main diagonal entries.

$\operatorname{tr}(A)=a_{11}+a_{22}$

1. The main diagonal entries are $5$ and $7$.

2. Add them only; do not multiply them or introduce other entries.

$5+7=12$

$12$ Dimensionless

$7+5=12$

Do not confuse trace with determinant.$mw$),
(575,369,$mw$1EAFD9632F2EF64F193637749476C8532D321685C64DF48DDB49ADAE7AD79610$mw$,$mw$c916a5c4ab71cbebeb1ca03d1ed73dee$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":369,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":14,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"اضرب المتجه (6،7) بالعدد 5.","TitleEn":"Multiply vector (6,7) by scalar 5.","QuestionTextAr":"اضرب المتجه (6،7) بالعدد 5.","QuestionTextEn":"Multiply vector (6,7) by scalar 5.","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون ضرب المتجه بعدد حقيقي: k(أ،ب) = (kأ، kب). عند ضرب المتجه (6،7) في العدد 5 نضرب كل مركبة مستقلة: (5×6، 5×7) = (30،35). لا نجمع المركبتين، لأن الناتج متجه ذو مركبتين.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Scalar-vector multiplication: k(a,b)=(ka,kb). Multiplying (6,7) by 5 scales each component: (5×6,5×7)=(30,35). The result remains a two-component vector.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1465,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(6,35)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1466,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(30,35)","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1467,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(11,12)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1468,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(35,30)","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد العامل العددي.","En":"Identify the scalar."},{"Ar":"اضرب كل مركبة بالعامل مع حفظ الترتيب.","En":"Multiply both components by the scalar in order."}],"Title":{"Ar":"اضرب المتجه (6،7) بالعدد 5.","En":"Multiply vector (6,7) by scalar 5."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"ضرب الثانية فقط وأبقى الأولى دون تغيير.","En":"Scales the second component only."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(6,35)"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"(30,35)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"جمع العامل بالمركبتين بدلاً من الضرب.","En":"Adds the scalar to both components instead of multiplying."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(11,12)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المركبتين.","En":"Swaps the component order."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(35,30)"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"اضرب المتجه (6،7) بالعدد 5.","En":"Multiply vector (6,7) by scalar 5."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب العددي يضرب كل مركبة بالعامل نفسه.","En":"Scalar multiplication scales each component by the same factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب المركبة الأولى $6$ في $5$.","En":"Multiply the first component $6$ by $5$."},{"Ar":"نضرب الثانية $7$ بالعامل نفسه ونحافظ على الترتيب.","En":"Multiply the second component $7$ by the same scalar and preserve order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(30,35)$","En":"$(30,35)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضف العامل أو تبدل المركبات.","En":"Do not add the scalar or swap components."},"FormulaLatex":"k(a,b)=(ka,kb)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5(6,7)=(5\\cdot6,5\\cdot7)=(30,35)$","En":"$5(6,7)=(5\\cdot6,5\\cdot7)=(30,35)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(30/5,35/5)=(6,7)$","En":"$(30/5,35/5)=(6,7)$"}},"TrackIds":[14,20],"CategoryId":14,"PrimarySkillId":65,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد العامل العددي.","En":"Identify the scalar."},{"Ar":"اضرب كل مركبة بالعامل مع حفظ الترتيب.","En":"Multiply both components by the scalar in order."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب العددي يضرب كل مركبة بالعامل نفسه.","En":"Scalar multiplication scales each component by the same factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب المركبة الأولى $6$ في $5$.","En":"Multiply the first component $6$ by $5$."},{"Ar":"نضرب الثانية $7$ بالعامل نفسه ونحافظ على الترتيب.","En":"Multiply the second component $7$ by the same scalar and preserve order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(30,35)$","En":"$(30,35)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضف العامل أو تبدل المركبات.","En":"Do not add the scalar or swap components."},"FormulaLatex":"k(a,b)=(ka,kb)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5(6,7)=(5\\cdot6,5\\cdot7)=(30,35)$","En":"$5(6,7)=(5\\cdot6,5\\cdot7)=(30,35)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(30/5,35/5)=(6,7)$","En":"$(30/5,35/5)=(6,7)$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"ضرب الثانية فقط وأبقى الأولى دون تغيير.","En":"Scales the second component only."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"جمع العامل بالمركبتين بدلاً من الضرب.","En":"Adds the scalar to both components instead of multiplying."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المركبتين.","En":"Swaps the component order."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الضرب العددي يضرب كل مركبة بالعامل نفسه.

$k(a,b)=(ka,kb)$

1. نضرب المركبة الأولى $6$ في $5$.

2. نضرب الثانية $7$ بالعامل نفسه ونحافظ على الترتيب.

$5(6,7)=(5\cdot6,5\cdot7)=(30,35)$

$(30,35)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(30/5,35/5)=(6,7)$

لا تضف العامل أو تبدل المركبات.$mw$,$mw$Scalar multiplication scales each component by the same factor.

$k(a,b)=(ka,kb)$

1. Multiply the first component $6$ by $5$.

2. Multiply the second component $7$ by the same scalar and preserve order.

$5(6,7)=(5\cdot6,5\cdot7)=(30,35)$

$(30,35)$ Dimensionless

$(30/5,35/5)=(6,7)$

Do not add the scalar or swap components.$mw$);
DO $audit$
DECLARE b record; d "CurriculumDraftItems"%ROWTYPE; p "Problems"%ROWTYPE; tr int; sk int; n int; actor int;
BEGIN
 FOR b IN SELECT * FROM reviewed_batch ORDER BY source LOOP
  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(-b.source::bigint);
  SELECT * INTO STRICT d FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "Id"=b.draft FOR UPDATE;
  SELECT * INTO STRICT p FROM "Problems" WHERE "Id"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "QuestionOptions" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  actor:=d."OwnerUserId"; tr:=(b.wizard->'TrackIds'->>0)::int; sk:=(b.wizard->>'PrimarySkillId')::int;
  IF d."SourceProblemId" IS DISTINCT FROM b.source OR d."Revision"<>0 OR d."EditorialStatus"<>'Draft' OR d."PublishedProblemId" IS NOT NULL OR d."SourceFingerprint" IS DISTINCT FROM b.fp OR md5(d."WizardJson") IS DISTINCT FROM b.draft_hash OR upper(encode(sha256(decode(b.source_hex,'hex')),'hex'))<>b.fp OR (SELECT json_build_object('Id',pp."Id",'StageId',pp."StageId",'CategoryId',pp."CategoryId",'Points',pp."Points",'TitleAr',pp."TitleAr",'TitleEn',pp."TitleEn",'QuestionTextAr',pp."QuestionTextAr",'QuestionTextEn',pp."QuestionTextEn",'DetailedSolutionAr',pp."DetailedSolutionAr",'DetailedSolutionEn',pp."DetailedSolutionEn",'YoutubeSolutionUrl',pp."YoutubeSolutionUrl",'EditorialDetailsJson',pp."EditorialDetailsJson",'Options',(select json_agg(json_build_object('Id',o."Id",'Order',o."Order",'LatexCode',o."LatexCode",'IsCorrect',o."IsCorrect") order by o."Order",o."Id") from "QuestionOptions" o where o."ProblemId"=pp."Id"))::jsonb FROM "Problems" pp WHERE pp."Id"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM b.snapshot THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Source/draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Users" WHERE "Id"=actor AND "Role"='Admin' AND "IsActive" AND NOT "StaffSetupPending") OR (SELECT count(*) FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "SourceProblemId"=b.source AND "EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn'))<>1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Owner/open-draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int) ORDER BY "Id" FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id"=tr AND "StageId"=p."StageId" AND "IsPublished" AND "Revision"<2147483647) OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Categories" WHERE "Id"=p."CategoryId" AND "StageId"=p."StageId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumSkills" s JOIN "CurriculumDomains" dm ON dm."Id"=s."DomainId" WHERE s."Id"=sk AND s."StageId"=p."StageId" AND s."CategoryId"=p."CategoryId" AND s."IsPublished" AND dm."IsPublished") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "SkillId"=sk) OR (SELECT array_agg("TrackId" ORDER BY "TrackId") FROM "LearningTrackProblems" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int ORDER BY 1) OR (SELECT array_agg("SkillId" ORDER BY "SkillId") FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY[sk] OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source AND "SkillId"=sk AND "IsPrimary") OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds') j(id) LEFT JOIN "LearningTracks" lt ON lt."Id"=j.id::int WHERE lt."Id" IS NULL OR lt."StageId"<>p."StageId" OR lt."Revision">=2147483647 OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "SkillId"=sk)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Scope conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Problems" q WHERE q."Id"<>b.source AND q."StageId"=p."StageId" AND (upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')) OR upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')))) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF b.wizard#>>'{Question,Ar}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextAr" OR b.wizard#>>'{Question,En}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextEn" OR length(b.flat_ar)>12000 OR length(b.flat_en)>12000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question/length conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  UPDATE "Problems" SET "TitleAr"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,Ar}',"TitleEn"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,En}',"DetailedSolutionAr"=b.flat_ar,"DetailedSolutionEn"=b.flat_en,"EditorialDetailsJson"=b.metadata WHERE "Id"=b.source;
  UPDATE "CurriculumDraftItems" SET "WizardJson"=b.wizard::text,"EditorialStatus"='Published',"Revision"=4,"SubmittedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedByUserId"=actor,"ReviewNote"='Owner-authorized SQL maintenance; AI educational review and source-locked verification. Existing draft owner recorded for attribution; no API login.',"PublishedAtUtc"=now(),"PublishedProblemId"=b.source WHERE "Id"=b.draft;
  UPDATE "LearningTracks" SET "Revision"="Revision"+1 WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int);
  INSERT INTO "PlatformActivityEvents"("ActorUserId","ActorRole","Action","Resource","ResourceId","Origin","CreatedAtUtc") SELECT actor,'Admin',action,'EditorialProblem',b.draft::text,'owner_sql',now() FROM unnest(ARRAY['EditorialDraftEdited','EditorialDraftSubmitted','EditorialDraftApproved','EditorialAmendmentPublished']) action;
 END LOOP;
END $audit$;
COMMIT;
